---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy Policy | Elevate Your Divine"
    description="Privacy policy for Elevate Your Divine."
>
    <Navbar />

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-40 md:pt-30">
        <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>

            <br />
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Last updated: September 19, 2026
            </p>

            <br />

            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                Elevate Your Divine respects your privacy. This policy explains
                how we collect, use, and protect information submitted through
                this website and information collected through its normal use.
            </p>

            <br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Information You Provide
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                When you contact us through this website, we may collect the
                information you choose to provide, including your name, business
                name, email address, phone number, area of interest, and message
                or inquiry details.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Website and Analytics Information
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the
                website. Analytics technologies may collect basic information
                such as pages visited, browser and device information, general
                location information, and identifiers used to distinguish
                visits. This information helps us understand site usage and
                improve the website.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                How We Use Information
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                We may use information to:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-zinc-200">
                <li>Respond to inquiries and provide requested information</li>
                <li>Evaluate prospective consulting or service engagements</li>
                <li>Deliver services if a business relationship is established</li>
                <li>Improve the website and understand how it is used</li>
                <li>Maintain appropriate business records</li>
            </ul>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Service Providers
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                We use third-party providers to operate this website and process
                submissions. These include Netlify for website hosting, form
                processing, and spam protection or reCAPTCHA features, and Google
                Analytics for website analytics. These providers may process
                information as needed to provide their services and are subject
                to their own privacy terms.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Data Security and Retention
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                We use reasonable measures intended to protect information we
                receive. No method of online transmission or storage is
                completely secure, however, and we cannot guarantee absolute
                security. We retain information for as long as reasonably needed
                for the purposes described in this policy, our business records,
                or an ongoing business relationship.
            </p>

            <br /><br />

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
                Contact Us
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">
                For questions about this Privacy Policy or the information you
                have submitted, contact us at
                <a href="mailto:elevateyourdivine@outlook.com">
                    elevateyourdivine@outlook.com
                </a>.
            </p>

            <br />
        </article>
    </main>

    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
